-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",290,{
[9249]="7006EC07\n1\tFind missing citizen (total: 5)\030Defeat Khûdi caracals (total: 11)\tYour mission is to travel to Tir Katar and put an end to the caracals who have been preying on nearby travellers and help any survivors you can find.\n2\tDefeat Amangísu\tFind and defeat the Khûdi caracal matron, Amangísu, in Tir Katar.\n",
[9250]="70030B95\n1\tFind a bucket and attempt to wake Rook's avanc\tRook wants you to attempt to wake his avanc so he can continue his journey to the East. He mentioned seeing a bucket along the edge of the Entwash.\n2\tTalk to Rook\tRook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.\n",
[9251]="700683D0\n1\tSpeak with Zerkho about the fauna in the hills\030Speak with Dorshet about the fauna in the hills\tSpeak with the expedition assistants to learn about the birds of prey and bog-lurkers on the Eastern Cape of Umbar. Though limited in use, there remains value in hunting these creatures. The assistants in the expedition camp will tell you more.\n2\tTalk to Luthana\tYou spoke with Zerkho and Dorshet. They do not think that there is a threat from the seahawks and bog-lurkers you hunt in the north. Return to Luthana in the expedition camp.\n",
[9252]="70030458\n1\tTalk to Baillas\tBaillas has come to Léofmar's side after all. The Ent stands before the Rohirrim in the centre of Fangorn's eaves. You should speak with Baillas.\n2\tGive the Kingsfoil to Léofmar to restore his health\tLéofmar is near Baillas. You should give the kingsfoil leaves to Léofmar to restore him to health.\n3\tThank Baillas for his kind deed\tBaillas is standing near Léofmar in Fangorn.\n",
[9253]="7004478E\n1\tLook upon the enemy forces from the wall\030Find a look-out spot on the wall\tThe Third Circle wall can be accessed via staircase, near to the Merry Swan. Lord Forlong has asked you to go up upon the walls in the Third Circle and look upon the enemy forces. NOTE: This objective requires emotes.\n2\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. You should return to Forlong with word of what you have seen.\n3\tTalk to Húrin, Warden of the Keys\tHúrin stands by the City Gates, which are at the centre of the First Circle of Minas Tirith. Forlong has asked you to ask Húrin, Warden of the Keys, about the state of preparation and if they can do anything to help.\n4\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. You should return to Forlong with Húrin's report.\n5\tListen to Neldir\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Neldir has to say.\n6\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n7\tListen to Forlong\030Listen to Neldir\030Listen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear whether Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir think the Sûhalar are kin of Dwarves or the Men of Lossarnach.\n8\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n9\tObtain Sûhalar beards (total: 12)\tThe Sûhalar can be found among the enemy's forces, especially north of the Rammas Echor in Talath Anor. Defeat and gather the beards of some Sûhalar, so that Forlong and company can judge if they are more like dwarves or Men.\n10\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Bring the Sûhalar beards back to Forlong, in the Merry Swan.\n11\tListen to Forlong\030Listen to Neldir\030Listen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir think of the Sûhalar beards you brought to them.\n12\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n13\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n14\tRaise a glass\tForlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. Make peace and drink with Forlong and company.\n15\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n16\tListen to Neldir\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Neldir has to say.\n17\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n18\tListen to Neldir\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Neldir has to say.\n19\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n20\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n21\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n22\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n23\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n24\tGo up to the Sixth Circle and inquire after Hirluin's old flame, Laranís, among the magistrates and councilors near the Dome of the Sun.\t\n25\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Return to Forlong with what you have learned of Laranís.\n26\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear Hirluin's reply.\n27\tListen to Neldir\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Neldir has to say.\n28\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n29\tFind Forlong's locket\tThe Southern Great Guest-house is in the Seventh Circle. Bring Forlong the locket of his wife and daughters. It is in his quarters in the Southern Great Guest-house.\n30\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Return to Forlong with his locket.\n31\tRaise a glass\tForlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. Raise a final glass and drink with Forlong and company.\n32\tTalk to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n",
[9254]="70022D67\n1\tTalk to Hal Gamgee in Oatbarton\tOatbarton is north of Brockenborings in the Shire. You will need to follow the path through the Greenfields to reach the town and seek out Hal Gamgee. Hal Gamgee can be found near the centre of Oatbarton.\n",
[9255]="7004A8DE\n1\tSignal Captain Róglarg\tCaptain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. You have gathered several sacrifices and now Captain Róglarg is prepared to bring them to Torech Ungol. You should get Captain Róglarg's attention and signal that you are ready to depart.\n2\tTalk to Legolas outside Cirith Ungol\tLegolas can be found along the road outside of Cirith Ungol. You have narrowly escaped the wrath of Shelob and her children. You should now speak to Legolas.\n",
[9256]="7004BEAD\n1\tSteal supplies from Fushaum Bal South (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should steal supplies from Fushaum Bal South while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to the Khundolar Commander\tThe Khundolar Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to the Khundolar Commander.\n",
[9257]="700072EA\n1\tDeliver the wine-cask to Brethilwen outside Limael's Vineyard\tYou will find Brethilwen to the north and west at the outskirts of Limael's Vineyard. Make your way along the roadway heading north-west out of Celondim and follow the small path along the river to the west to find her. Bregedúr, the local cooper at Celondim, asked you to deliver a cask to his friend Brethilwen at Limael's Vineyard.\n",
[9258]="7005AAFC\n1\tCollect fallen branches (total: 10)\tDréri has asked you to look around the nearby area for firewood. You should collect fallen branches near Fellgát.\n2\tBuild camp-fires (total: 4)\tNow that you have some firewood, you should build camp-fires in Fellgát.\n3\tLight camp-fires (total: 4)\tThe camp-fires in Fellgát have been assembled, but now they need to be set alight.\n4\tTalk to Dréri\tThe camp-fires have been lit, protecting Fellgát from the chill of the mountains. You should talk to Dréri.\n",
[9259]="7000000B\n1\tTalk to Bounder Chubb\tBounder Chubb can be found on duty near the road leading into Needlehole, due north of Michel Delving, north-west of Hobbiton. Shirriff Smallburrow has asked you to travel to Needlehole and offer your services to Bounder Chubb.\n",
[9260]="70066EE6\n1\tYou have stumbled into the affairs of Little Pip and Vexed Meldis. Does one of Tadrent's haystacks hold a valuable treasure?\t\n2\tWait...\tThere is no needle in that haystack after all.\n3\tTalk to Little Pip by the haystack in question\tLittle Pip stands by the haystack in question at the northern entrance of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.\n",
[9261]="70058FC7\n1\tCollect bundles of intact Orkish arrows at Zarkul-sulûn (total: 9)\tIntact Orkish arrows can be found scattered in the ground at Zarkul-sulûn. Hoping to arm Zhélruka archers, Rádek has asked you to collect intact Orkish arrows from the ground at Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tZhélruka archers can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You have collected the Orkish arrows and should now deliver them to Zhélruka archers at Zarkul-sulûn.\t\n3\tTalk to Rádek\tRádek can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You have armed the Zhélruka archers and should now report back to Rádek.\n",
[9262]="7006C97C\n1\tTalk to Zidek\tZidek is trying to send the hungry dog away. You should talk to Zidek.\n2\tGive food to the hungry dog\tZidek tried sending the hungry dog away, but you took pity upon the animal and bought some meat for the dog. You should give it to him.\n3\tGive the dog a pat.\tYou have given meat you bought from Zidek to the hungry stray and can see that he is a gentle and intelligent dog. You should give him some pats.\n4\tTalk to Zidek\tYou have given meat you bought from Zidek to the hungry stray and can see that he is a gentle and intelligent dog. Afterward, you gave the good dog some pats that did not go unappreciated. You should talk to Zidek.\n5\tCarry the steak to Ubdun outside Jirush\tZidek said he would feed the dog if he serves as the protector and companion of Ubdun the goatherd. He has pointed to a large, juicy steak on the table, and asked you to take it and see if the dog will follow you to Ubdun.\n6\tTalk to Ubdun\tThe dog has followed you, or rather the steak, to Ubdun's location, near Jirush. You should talk to Ubdun.\n",
[9263]="7006BF7B\n1\tSpeak with Girnada, Quartermaster of Urmâkh\030Speak with Mushêndu, a farmer in Urmâkh\030Speak with Entârshul\030Speak with Nukûsh, Blacksmith of Urmâkh\tMizâdi has asked that you speak with residents of Urmâkh to help with their needs. Specifically, she's asked you speak with Girnada, Mushêndu, Entârshul and Nukûsh in Urmâkh.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tReturn to Mizâdi in Urmâkh now that you have heard the needs of the people of Urmâkh.\n",
[9264]="7001A9AB\n1\tDefeat Neekerbreekers in Andrath (total: 12)\tThe swamp to the north and east of the Watcher's position outside the Southwatch is home to noisy Neekerbreekers. Watcher Oakdale has asked for your assistance in eliminating the creatures so that he might find a pleasing rest.\n2\tReturn to Watcher Oakdale\tWatcher Oakdale will be pleased to know that the number of neekers near his encampment at the east edge of the north edge of the Southwatch is diminished. Watcher Oakdale has asked for your assistance in eliminating the creatures so that he might find a pleasing rest.\n",
[9265]="70007A32\n1\tBring the sickle-fly wings to Roderik Neeker-friend\030Collect greater sickle-fly wings (total: 4)\tGreater sickle-flies are found mainly in the southern Midgewater Marshes. Roderick Neeker-friend is camped atop a cliff near the Goblinhole Ruins in the south-east part of the Midgewater Marshes. Roderick Neeker-friend asked you to collect wings from the sickle-flies found in the Midgewater Marshes to help feed his pet Neekerbreeker, Sniken.\n",
[9266]="7000787F\n1\tDefeat Neekerbreekers in the Midgewater Marshes (total: 8)\tThe Midgewater Marshes lie to the east of Staddle, beyond Swatmidge's farm. Watcher Reedy is worried that the growing Neekerbreeker population in the north of the Midgewater Marshes poses a threat to Staddle that is being overlooked by the watchers because of the goblin troubles.\n2\tTalk to Edda Twiggins\tEdda Twiggins can be found out in the Midgewater Marshes, south-east of the ruins. Watcher Reedy asked you to check in with the Watchers stationed in the Marshes after you succeeded in thinning the numbers of the Neekerbreekers in the Marshes.\n",
[9267]="70040908\n1\tTry to negotiate with Jajax\tJajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel. You should speak with Jajax.\n2\tMake your way to Calembel and speak with someone there\tCalembel, the main city of Lamedon, can be found south of Lothgobel. You should leave the Corsairs to their business and make your way to Calembel.\n",
[9268]="700561E1\n1\tGather pies (total: 4)\tFresh pies can be found in the Rohan Eastfold Homesteads. You should gather the pies.\n2\tDeliver pies (total: 4)\tDeliver the pies to the doorsteps of your neighbors within the Rohan Eastfold Homesteads.\n",
[9269]="7002C607\n1\tMake a case to chase out the true enemy, not the Rohirrim\tThe hunter lies dead on a hilltop in Thinglad, a forest guarded closely by the Elves of Lórien. You should search the dead hunter once more to make an argument for chasing the true enemy out of Thinglad.\n2\tTalk to Wynmar\tWynmar stands at the site of the Orc-siege in Thinglad. You should speak with Wynmar.\n",
[9270]="70065D24\n1\tSee what Sam has for you\tSamwise Gamgee, aside from being a great adventurer on his own, wants to help you with your own adventures. Speak with him and he will reward you with a gift of sorts; as any good hobbit would.\n",
[9271]="7000E8F9\n1\tCollect Limael's Vintage from Celondim\tLimael's Vintage can be purchased in Celondim in Ered Luin. You should collect Limael's Vintage from a Vintner in Celondim.\n2\tBring Limael's Vintage to Wesley Hopwood at Thornley's Worksite\tWesley Hopwood is at Thornley's Work-site in Bree-land, far to the east of Ered Luin. Wesley Hopwood has told you that he will never be able to travel to Celondim in Ered Luin to find the \"Limael's Vintage\" he needs to complete the Inn League's Challenge. He has asked you to collect some of the wine for him.\n",
[9272]="700216C2\n1\tCollect fake Limael's Vintage from The Prancing Pony\tIsenwine, the decoy for Limael's Vintage, can be obtained at The Prancing Pony in Bree. You should head to The Prancing Pony and collect some Isenwine from Barliman Butterbur, which you will deliver to Wesley Hopwood under the guise of Limael's Vintage.\n2\tBring the fake Limael's Vintage to Wesley Hopwood\tWesley Hopwood is at Thornley's Worksite in Bree. You should bring the Isenwine, cleverly disguised as Limael's Vintage, to Wesley Hopwood. He needs the latter wine to complete the Inn League Challenge.\n",
[9273]="70062E7E\n1\tDefeat brigands at Gaervarad (total: 10)\tBrigands have been massing to the south, at Gaervarad in Ruddymore, and Rothavron does not want the villains to be unopposed.\n2\tTalk to Rothavron at Sarn Ford\tRothavron is at Sarn Ford.\n",
[9274]="70027B4C\n1\tFind Déormund\030Find Herestan\tTwo of Théodred's men went to scout the lake's edge: Déormund to the north-west and Herestan to the north. They have not returned, and Hogawise wants you to find them.\n2\tTalk to Hogawise at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras\tHogawise is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.\n",
[9275]="70061F19\n1\tCollect stewing herbs from Tangwen\030Collect potatoes\030Collect a loaf of bread\030Collect a bottle of Crossway House's finest\030Collect ruddy-coat goat meat (total: 8)\tRhiangar Nevit has asked you gather supplies for her family's favourite stew. Ruddy-coat goats can be found west of Herne, and the rest of the ingredients can be collected from the local townsfolk, many of whom can be found at Crossway House, Herne's inn. You should gather ingredients for Rhiangar.\n2\tReturn to Rhiangar\tRhiangar is in the Mayor's house, in Herne. You should being the ingredients for dinner to Rhiangar.\n",
[9276]="7002E7A5\n1\tSeek out the Stable-help in Combe\tCombe is located south of Archet and east of Bree-town in Bree.\n",
[9277]="7002D3F0\n1\tTell Thórhall of the fungus you saw\tThórhall is at the small dwarf-encampment at Lamab-dûm. You should tell Thórhall of the strange fungus you found in the Palace of Náin.\n2\tTell someone in the Dolven-view camp about the fungus\tThe Dolven-view camp is the central dwarf-hub in the Great Delving. You should bring word of the strange fungus you marked to someone in the Dolven-view.\n",
[9278]="70070CC8\n1\tGather crocodile hides (total: 10)\030Defeat Adagím crocodiles (total: 15)\tYour mission is to travel to the west of Sul Madásh to the Lair of the Shadlúgai and gather crocodile hides.\n2\tDefeat the hulking crocodile\tYour mission is to travel to the west of Sul Madásh to the Lair of the Shadlúgai and gather crocodile hides.\n",
[9279]="700660D9\n1\tTalk to Berthang\tDornach asked you to go into Ethring to recruit new workers. Talk to prospective workers in Ethring.\n2\tTalk to Dornach\tYou have spoken to people in the town and found some promising candidates. Talk to Dornach at the lumber camp east of Ethring.\n",
[9280]="7000A8FA\n1\tCollect priceless relics (total: 15)\tThe entrance to the tomb is on the island beyond the bridge of Ariant, on the highest level of the city. Glangilith has asked you to recover priceless relics from Haudh Valandil before the Angmarim ruin them.\n",
})
